<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίχαρ-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wherein one feels joy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1262
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεραροῖς ἐπίχαρτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					722
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> more
			freq., <i>wherein one feels malignant joy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχθροῖς ἐπίχαρτα πέπονθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					159
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δικαίως τι πάσχοντες ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.67
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				45.85
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρβάροις ἐ. γενόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					356b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
